+    <description summary="host appearance for its private X11 compatibility bridge">
+      Optional host preference delivery. Only the compositor's authenticated
+      compatibility client may bind. Satellite retains XSettings ownership and
+      its DPI entries; the host supplies the toolkit theme name. The initial
+      event is sent at bind, with later events on preference changes.
